        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the login is successful, the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the login status check (modeled as action n3), the branching decision point (b1), the success condition guard (b1->n4), the explicit end action (n4), and the termination node (e1)."
    },
    {
